       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2961919de700a07ec22a098da2a90a31?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMD-0.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Michael Durbin",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>First, I'll update the behavior for fcrepo4 so that whenever possible, operations against paths that have pairtree nodes work as if no resource were there.  (ie, you CAN create a new resource there, you CANNOT perform updates, etc.)</p>",
     "created": "19/May/15 12:26 PM",
     "id": "14302",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11482/comment/14302",
